WEBVTT

00:02.160 --> 00:04.460
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:04.600 --> 00:07.630
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:08.140 --> 00:10.870
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:10.870 --> 00:15.500
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:15.940 --> 00:22.910
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:24.650 --> 00:27.520
Dragon Drive

00:27.520 --> 00:33.020
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:33.160 --> 00:36.130
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:36.130 --> 00:39.360
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:39.870 --> 00:44.240
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:44.240 --> 00:46.210
ima mo
I'd still...

00:46.210 --> 00:52.510
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:54.250 --> 00:56.620
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:56.620 --> 00:59.820
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

01:00.160 --> 01:05.160
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:05.160 --> 01:06.720
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:06.860 --> 01:09.260
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:09.260 --> 01:12.390
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:12.800 --> 01:17.870
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:17.870 --> 01:20.610
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:20.610 --> 01:28.710
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:40.660 --> 01:41.920
Now, do it!

01:42.200 --> 01:44.560
You need me, right? Shinryu!

01:51.770 --> 01:53.600
We won't let you have Shinryu!

01:54.310 --> 01:56.170
And can you lot do anything about it?

01:56.580 --> 01:57.880
We'll give it our best shot!

01:59.410 --> 02:02.180
Idiots. You guys can't do it.

02:05.050 --> 02:06.250
Disappear.

02:17.000 --> 02:18.470
What's with this thing?!

02:35.820 --> 02:37.440
Where am I?

02:38.590 --> 02:40.020
This is my room.

02:41.420 --> 02:43.360
Was it a dream?

02:46.290 --> 02:49.630
Shinryu

03:18.160 --> 03:21.820
I sealed away Shinryu... right?

03:23.830 --> 03:25.420
I sealed it away...

03:25.970 --> 03:27.940
...so I was able to return home.

03:29.870 --> 03:32.640
That's right. That has to be it.

03:34.310 --> 03:35.670
Or maybe...

03:36.880 --> 03:38.180
...it was a dream?

03:48.790 --> 03:50.920
Maybe Maiko and Daisuke are back too.

03:51.160 --> 03:52.680
I'll go and ask them!

03:54.700 --> 03:55.600
25th Sakura Junior High Cultural Festival

03:55.600 --> 03:59.200
25th Sakura Junior High Cultural Festival
A message from
the Cultural Festival Committee.

03:59.200 --> 03:59.230
25th Sakura Junior High Cultural Festival

03:59.230 --> 04:02.290
25th Sakura Junior High Cultural Festival
Miyazaki and Amada of Class 2A...

04:03.000 --> 04:05.270
...please return to the audio-visual room.

04:06.140 --> 04:08.940
- I repeat...
- You're late, Reiji!

04:09.180 --> 04:11.700
- Huh?!
- Don't just stand there. Help us!

04:11.810 --> 04:13.040
Maiko!

04:14.050 --> 04:15.540
I borrowed this curtain for you.

04:15.820 --> 04:17.440
Thanks for your help, Daisuke.

04:17.920 --> 04:20.980
- And this isn't even your class!
- It's my pleasure!

04:21.320 --> 04:22.910
H-Hey guys...

04:22.990 --> 04:23.690
Florist

04:23.960 --> 04:25.890
Come on! You showed up late...

04:25.960 --> 04:28.120
...you'd better work hard to make up for it!

04:29.760 --> 04:30.570
Haunted Mansion

04:30.570 --> 04:32.470
Haunted Mansion
This is weird...

04:32.800 --> 04:35.830
Nobody remembers anything
about Dragon Drive.

04:36.740 --> 04:39.570
It's as if it never happened.

04:42.140 --> 04:44.200
Could it really have been a dream?

04:45.510 --> 04:46.310
- Hey!
- Ow!

04:46.380 --> 04:47.780
Hurry up and get working!

04:47.850 --> 04:48.550
25th Sakura Junior High Cultural Festival

04:48.550 --> 04:53.210
25th Sakura Junior High Cultural Festival
But it felt so real for a dream.

04:58.730 --> 04:59.780
What's wrong?

04:59.860 --> 05:01.420
Let's hurry home.

05:01.730 --> 05:04.930
We beat Shinryu, didn't we?

05:06.270 --> 05:08.290
Wh-What's Shinryu?

05:08.840 --> 05:10.100
What are you talking about?

05:10.340 --> 05:11.460
Don't you remember?!

05:12.210 --> 05:14.770
We went to Rikyu and fought there!

05:15.080 --> 05:17.440
You must've had a dream or something.

05:17.750 --> 05:19.270
That's right, Reiji.

05:19.350 --> 05:21.140
It was a dream. A dream.

05:24.750 --> 05:26.950
I'm going home now, okay?

05:28.560 --> 05:29.920
What are you hiding?!

05:29.990 --> 05:32.790
- I'm not hiding anything.
- Really?!

05:32.930 --> 05:35.190
Don't you believe us?

05:47.780 --> 05:51.140
Chibi's calling me.

05:52.510 --> 05:54.810
The battle is still going on!

05:59.290 --> 06:00.980
Don't go, Reiji!

06:05.490 --> 06:08.720
We can't beat Shinryu.

06:15.170 --> 06:18.330
Why do we have to
fight, anyway?

06:18.970 --> 06:21.000
Tell me. Why?!

06:21.680 --> 06:23.670
Aren't you scared, Reiji?

06:25.010 --> 06:27.170
I was scared.

06:27.880 --> 06:29.410
When I saw Shinryu...

06:30.720 --> 06:32.690
...I could hardly stand.

06:34.920 --> 06:36.820
You can laugh if you want.

06:37.560 --> 06:40.530
But... I can't take it anymore.

06:41.360 --> 06:42.350
I understand.

06:43.870 --> 06:45.700
You two can wait here in this world.

06:45.970 --> 06:47.870
- Reiji!
- You'll be killed!

06:47.940 --> 06:50.730
But I still have to go.

06:52.040 --> 06:53.870
I can't give up without finishing this.

06:54.880 --> 07:00.140
I decided that I would never
push the reset button again!

07:00.550 --> 07:01.310
Reiji!

07:18.130 --> 07:19.100
Meguru!

07:29.010 --> 07:30.480
It's no use. It has no effect!

07:30.710 --> 07:33.700
Where the heck have
Reiji and the others gone?!

07:39.190 --> 07:40.150
Mahiru!

07:41.790 --> 07:43.190
Will you help us?!

07:46.290 --> 07:48.590
There's no time to think it over!

07:50.630 --> 07:52.530
Shinryu belongs to me!

07:53.230 --> 07:55.200
Don't interfere.

08:06.610 --> 08:07.910
I must hurry!

08:08.780 --> 08:13.650
I must make Shinryu my servant
before it completely awakens.

08:15.160 --> 08:16.320
Shinryu.

08:16.390 --> 08:18.620
It hasn't completely awakened yet...

08:18.730 --> 08:22.420
...and yet it managed to throw me
out of D-Z one, along with those kids.

08:27.170 --> 08:28.400
Marvelous!

08:28.470 --> 08:30.490
Now that is Shinryu!

08:30.570 --> 08:31.740
Power that can take over all worlds!

08:31.740 --> 08:33.740
Sea Palace
Power that can take over all worlds!

08:33.740 --> 08:36.870
Sea Palace

08:40.620 --> 08:42.170
What's going on?!

08:50.960 --> 08:54.660
"Never push the reset button," huh...

08:59.470 --> 09:00.830
What's happening?!

09:05.210 --> 09:06.470
What's wrong, Shinryu?!

09:16.220 --> 09:17.150
What?!

09:25.790 --> 09:27.890
It won't listen to a word you say.

09:29.630 --> 09:32.330
Your servant?
Don't make me laugh!

09:32.730 --> 09:34.860
K-Kouhei.

09:39.670 --> 09:41.370
The dragon called for my help.

09:41.810 --> 09:44.610
It told me that it needed my help to awaken.

09:52.150 --> 09:55.180
For you, this is...
Game Over!

09:55.590 --> 09:59.990
Sh-Shinryu.

10:06.200 --> 10:07.170
D-Z one...

10:07.840 --> 10:09.830
...wasn't made for people like him.

10:11.410 --> 10:12.840
Take it back from them!

10:12.940 --> 10:14.810
Dragon Drive is yours!

10:16.180 --> 10:17.470
We'll go too!

10:20.920 --> 10:23.110
Sea Palace

10:23.450 --> 10:25.350
After all, If we're not with you...

10:25.490 --> 10:26.890
...there's no telling what Reiji will do!

10:29.590 --> 10:32.720
Thank you, Maiko. Daisuke.

10:38.200 --> 10:38.600
Sea Palace

10:38.600 --> 10:41.590
Sea Palace
Well, we have to go now, big sister.

10:42.300 --> 10:43.600
Be careful.

10:44.810 --> 10:47.100
No way! Are those two?

10:47.440 --> 10:48.310
Right.

10:48.380 --> 10:50.740
L is Meguru's older sister.

10:51.180 --> 10:52.110
Oh...

11:00.020 --> 11:00.990
Chibi.

11:06.790 --> 11:08.790
We're counting on you.

11:10.830 --> 11:13.130
D-BREAK!!

11:33.950 --> 11:38.150
Shinryu is trying to swallow up the world.

11:40.130 --> 11:43.460
We are all depending on you, Reiji.

11:53.370 --> 11:54.340
Mahiru!

11:56.110 --> 11:57.630
Don't be reckless, Mahiru!

12:18.600 --> 12:19.960
I don't need you.

12:20.130 --> 12:22.470
You can all vanish!

12:40.790 --> 12:41.650
Hikaru!

12:41.720 --> 12:45.060
How pathetic,
struggling against an opponent like this.

12:45.730 --> 12:47.130
Shut up!

12:47.290 --> 12:49.350
We left it for you, that's all!

12:49.960 --> 12:51.690
Then I'll go finish it off!

13:05.280 --> 13:08.370
What a pointless attack.

13:23.730 --> 13:26.330
I expect you to keep your promise.

13:26.470 --> 13:28.440
K-Kyoji.

13:44.850 --> 13:45.650
Mahiru!

13:49.090 --> 13:50.610
T-this is...

13:50.720 --> 13:52.320
I kept it to remember Yakou.

13:52.390 --> 13:54.020
- I'm giving it to you.
- What?!

13:54.660 --> 13:57.690
Take that back to Rikyu with you.

13:58.800 --> 14:00.100
Got it?

14:05.040 --> 14:06.010
Rockaku!

14:14.780 --> 14:16.910
A-A barrier?!

14:17.520 --> 14:20.180
You are an eyesore.

14:32.170 --> 14:34.100
Guys!

14:34.540 --> 14:36.130
Sorry to keep you waiting!

14:43.610 --> 14:45.270
Not being able to fly is a real disadvantage.

14:45.350 --> 14:46.140
Maiko!

14:46.510 --> 14:48.610
Sorry I'm late! We all came together!

14:48.820 --> 14:50.680
All? Where's Reiji?

14:55.820 --> 14:57.520
Sorry to keep you waiting, everyone!

14:58.630 --> 15:00.320
Reiji! You came back!

15:00.390 --> 15:01.220
Of course!

15:01.560 --> 15:03.960
Okay! Let's put an end to it this time!

15:04.270 --> 15:05.230
Right!

15:06.830 --> 15:08.430
Okay, let's go, Chibi!

15:09.370 --> 15:11.030
GO!

15:19.610 --> 15:22.840
SinnSaber!

15:38.830 --> 15:40.660
Kouhei! I'm gonna settle this,
once and for all!

16:00.650 --> 16:02.350
Reiji Ohzora.

16:02.420 --> 16:05.090
You've always been in my way.

16:06.230 --> 16:08.090
Today, I put an end to you!

16:10.030 --> 16:11.430
This is bad. It's huge!

16:11.830 --> 16:13.890
Bigger doesn't mean better!

16:18.640 --> 16:20.770
It's my turn to attack!

16:33.720 --> 16:35.020
My head...

16:35.090 --> 16:37.460
Feels like my head's about to crack.

16:59.480 --> 17:00.850
Ichirou!

17:01.120 --> 17:04.310
I promised to protect you.

17:05.920 --> 17:06.890
Ichirou!

17:14.630 --> 17:17.220
What should... I do?!

17:31.050 --> 17:34.670
This boring world is better off gone!

17:46.890 --> 17:48.690
I won't let you do this.

17:58.670 --> 18:00.300
Wh-What?!

18:02.540 --> 18:04.410
This could save the world.

18:04.480 --> 18:05.270
Huh?

18:05.350 --> 18:09.870
It looks like Shinryu's energy
can't be confined to D-Z one alone.

18:12.420 --> 18:14.550
If it leaks outside of D-Z one...

18:14.620 --> 18:18.420
...we'll be lucky if Earth is
the only thing destroyed.

18:19.190 --> 18:21.890
But if that energy could be
directed elsewhere...

18:25.430 --> 18:26.960
Help me, sister!

18:28.000 --> 18:29.330
Help me!

18:29.400 --> 18:31.000
What are you talking about?

18:32.010 --> 18:34.000
Dragon Drive, was it?

18:34.440 --> 18:37.380
- You're playing that game too much.
- No!

18:37.440 --> 18:41.070
It's not just a game!
It's something much more terrifying.

18:41.920 --> 18:42.880
Meguru.

18:42.950 --> 18:45.540
Can't you tell what's real and what's not?

18:48.490 --> 18:51.080
Goodbye, sister.

18:58.930 --> 19:00.520
I'm sorry, Meguru.

19:01.200 --> 19:05.260
If only I had believed you then.

19:12.150 --> 19:14.380
Give it a rest!

19:24.220 --> 19:26.250
You're so naive!

19:36.040 --> 19:37.000
Meguru!

19:43.010 --> 19:44.480
Now to finish you off!

19:57.060 --> 19:58.580
Wh-What?!

20:10.840 --> 20:11.860
Sister!

20:14.410 --> 20:16.380
I can't move.

20:19.410 --> 20:20.940
N-Now!

20:21.780 --> 20:22.610
Rockaku!

20:28.920 --> 20:29.890
Meguru.

20:30.860 --> 20:32.050
Sister.

20:32.630 --> 20:33.920
I'm sorry, Meguru.

20:35.060 --> 20:36.050
Sister!

20:46.310 --> 20:47.530
Sister.

20:54.750 --> 20:57.410
Honestly... you're pushing yourself too hard.

21:00.450 --> 21:02.580
You almost got killed, you know.

21:06.590 --> 21:07.890
Don't worry.

21:07.960 --> 21:10.230
I'll get reinforcements somehow.

21:11.130 --> 21:12.100
Rockaku!

21:21.680 --> 21:23.300
Reiji! Now!

21:23.380 --> 21:25.370
Forget me, finish Shinryu!

21:26.610 --> 21:29.380
Now's our only chance! Do it, Reiji!

21:29.720 --> 21:31.780
Now I'll have my revenge
against Yakou's killer!

21:34.590 --> 21:36.420
Blow us all away!

21:56.780 --> 21:59.440
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:59.510 --> 22:02.210
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:02.280 --> 22:06.220
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:07.690 --> 22:10.380
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:10.460 --> 22:12.620
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:13.090 --> 22:17.190
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:18.630 --> 22:21.230
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:21.300 --> 22:23.960
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:24.040 --> 22:28.000
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:29.340 --> 22:31.780
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:31.850 --> 22:34.780
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:34.850 --> 22:39.720
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:40.390 --> 22:43.050
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:43.120 --> 22:45.820
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:45.890 --> 22:50.520
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:51.260 --> 22:53.960
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:54.030 --> 22:56.630
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:56.700 --> 23:01.330
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:02.010 --> 23:06.500
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:07.450 --> 23:13.110
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:15.320 --> 23:17.950
Next time

23:18.330 --> 23:20.450
It's finally time to settle things
once and for all!

23:21.060 --> 23:24.860
But what does Shinryu have planned,
becoming that big?!

23:24.970 --> 23:27.330
Absorb! Absorb!

23:27.400 --> 23:30.560
What?! D-Z one's being sucked up?!

23:31.370 --> 23:34.470
At this rate, it'll also swallow up
Earth and Rikyu!

23:34.540 --> 23:36.340
All gone! All gone!

23:36.480 --> 23:39.600
Next, on Dragon Drive, "D-Break!"

23:39.780 --> 23:41.770
Okay, we'll use SinnSaber!

23:41.850 --> 23:42.520
Doesn't work!

23:42.520 --> 23:42.880
D-Break!
Doesn't work!

23:42.880 --> 23:42.920
D-Break!

23:42.920 --> 23:45.010
D-Break!
No way!
